sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as SocialRoute
  participant S as SocialService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>R: GET /social/messages/eligibility/:userId
  R->>S: getDirectMessageEligibility(me, target)
  S->>DB: 查询拉黑、关注、隐私设置
  S-->>R: 返回是否可发
  U->>R: POST /social/messages/:userId
  R->>S: sendMessage(me, target, content)
  S->>DB: 创建或复用 conversation
  S->>DB: 写 direct_messages 并更新 last_message_at
  S-->>R: 发送成功
  R-->>U: 201 Created
